{'symbol': 'KO', 'date': '2023-05-12 10:00:00', 'title': 'THE COCA-COLA COMPANY ANNOUNCES PARTICIPATION IN DBACCESS GLOBAL CONSUMER CONFERENCE', 'text': "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE COCA-COLA COMPANY ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER JOHN MURPHY WILL PRESENT AT THE DBACCESS GLOBAL CONSUMER CONFERENCE IN PARIS ON JUNE 8 AT 5 A.M. ET (11 A.M. CENTRAL EUROPEAN TIME). THE COMPANY INVITES INVESTORS TO JOIN A WEBCAST OF THE EVENT AT COCA-COLACOMPANY.COM/INVESTORS. A DOWNLOADABLE FILE, AS WELL AS A TRANSCRIPT, WILL BE AVAILABLE WITHIN 24 HOURS AFTER THE EVENT ON THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE. ABOUT THE COCA-COLA COMPANY THE COCA-COLA."}